    "explanation": "enrichment-svc reloaded GEOIP_API_KEY at version 16 and the previous version was revoked (line 169); the new value is not one the geo-IP provider accepts, so every call gets 401 Unauthorized (lines 179, 181, 189, 192). A 401 is the provider answering correctly, not an outage. ingest-api's 502s (lines 174, 194, 211, 232) and ingest-gateway's (lines 177, 186, 195, 206, 212, 219, 227) are symptoms. Red herrings: lines 85, 90 (a deploy of event-processor, which is not on the failing request path and kept processing normally); lines 21, 22 (a single geo-IP provider connection reset that succeeded on retry, minutes before onset).",
